// Mission TT2_5, OpenTT's own map: generated.
// Night of the Living Brains (tt2_5): OpenTT's own blue map (a 300 m mission area), Halloween night, king of the hill,
// rings and crescents round the hill, point symmetric (turned half round for the other team).
// Layout (x east, y north; green spawns south, blue north):
// (0, 0)       the ritual hill (121 m, flat to r 30, its foot r 54): the old stone circle (r 24) on
// its top, two trilithon doorways (south and north), open east and west by two fallen
// stones, glowing pumpkins round a knoll in the middle, a power-up;
// r 54..74     the pumpkin patch, a sunken ring (109 m): three curving furrow ridges broken by
// staggered gaps, boulders with heaps of glowing pumpkins; power-ups, boost pads up
// the hill on the lanes;
// r 96         a crescent ridge on each side (south, north; 7 m over the plain), open towards the
// hill, a notch in its middle for the lane (the reload arch in it), knolls with a jack-o'-lantern
// at its tips (46 degrees either side of the axis; power-ups on two);
// r 98         east and west the witch's gullies, misty crescent hollows (floor 99 m, misty to
// 101.5 m; 12..18 m wide), ramps at both ends: the low routes round the hill, bones and
// a power-up on each floor; a jump pad at the patch's edge over each;
// r 110..150   the plain behind the crescents (116 m): the spawns, groves of dead trees, a lone
// tree with pumpkins among the spawns on each side, heals
// beyond the gullies; two cobbled lanes from the south and north edges through the
// crescents' notches up to the doorways, lit jack-o'-lanterns along them from the arch to the boost, boulders across their ends at the plateau's edge.
// See tt_assets::data::mission.
